      "rationale": "This macro equation expands bfBody into the exact MPY statement term for the submitted function, so it defines a named program term rather than adding an execution or mathematical fact.",
      "recomputed_normalized_sha256": "0629da93c5130935249ecfa4991c65d2afaaca2b33ec20afc6a779f158c11014",
